Package: midasINLA
Title: Spatial MIDAS Models Using INLA
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Stephen Jun", "Villejo",
        email = "s.villejo@imperial.ac.uk",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides tools for fitting spatial Mixed-Data Sampling (MIDAS) regression models using Integrated Nested Laplace Approximation (INLA) (Rue et al., 2009) <doi:10.1111/j.1467-9868.2008.00700.x>. The package is designed for settings where responses and explanatory variables are observed at different temporal frequencies and supports both constant and spatially varying regression coefficients.
